    <bpmn:process id="W_W1400" name="W1400. Driver License Expiration Monitoring, LTO Compliance &amp; Renewal Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly compliance review cycle; or LTO license expiration approaching (system alert at 60-day, 30-day, and 7-day thresholds)
Frequency: Monthly review; continuous system monitoring
Volume: ~40 owned-fleet drivers + ~15 DC spotter/yard drivers = ~55 drivers requiring valid professional driver&#x27;s licenses (PDL); ~55 licenses tracked, with ~11 expirations/year under the LTO 5-year validity, on rolling monthly monitoring
Owner: Fleet Maintenance Supervisor
Participants: Fleet Maintenance Supervisor, HR Assistant, Driver, LTO
Source: workflow W1400 — Driver License Expiration Monitoring, LTO Compliance &amp; Renewal Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1400_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1400_Lane1" name="Fleet Maintenance Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1400_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
